{"symbol":"NISUS","yahoo":"NISUS.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Nisus Finance Services Co Limited","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Asset Management","website":"https://nisusfin.com","about":"Nisus Finance Services Co Limited provides consulting and advisory services for real estate, infrastructure, financial services fields in India. It operates through Transaction Advisory Services; Fund and Asset Management; and Civil Construction segments. The company offers project development support, maintenance, management, administration, research, maintenance of date base, and planning, auctioneering, surveying, valuation, sourcing, agency, and marketing services. It also raises and manages institutional capital through alternative investment funds (AIFs) focused on real estate credit. In addition, the company provides transaction advisory solutions, such as private equity and structured credit, financial advisory and structuring, asset monetization, and warehousing and land aggregation for developers, financial institutions, and asset owners; and lending solutions comprising SME finance, real estate finance, and venture debt finance. Further, it is involved in engineering, procurement, and construction business. The company was incorporated in 2013 and is based in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:44:36+00:00","quote":{"price":166.05,"prevClose":157.65,"marketCap":396.49,"high52":383.5,"low52":142.65,"pe":6.05,"bookValue":112.44,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":null,"shares":2.3878,"insiders":79.31,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2024-12-11","2024-12-12","2024-12-13","2024-12-16","2024-12-17","2024-12-18","2024-12-19","2024-12-20","2024-12-23","2024-12-24","2024-12-26","2024-12-27","2024-12-30","2024-12-31","2025-01-01","2025-01-02","2025-01-03","2025-01-06","2025-01-07","2025-01-08","2025-01-09","2025-01-10","2025-01-13","2025-01-14","2025-01-15","2025-01-16","2025-01-17","2025-01-20","2025-01-21","2025-01-22","2025-01-23","2025-01-24","2025-01-27","2